241 | </head>
242 | <body>
243 | 
244 | <header>
245 |   <h1>🔍 BugSleuth</h1>
246 |   <span>Incident investigation powered by structured evidence</span>
247 | </header>
248 | 
249 | <main>
250 |   <!-- ── Input Sidebar ── -->
251 |   <aside>
252 |     <h2>Evidence Input</h2>
253 | 
254 |     <div>
255 |       <label for="description">Incident description</label>
